                       * set punch prefix "CIV_QSO"                                                      *
                       * radius = 21.500 23.500                                                          *
                       * iterate to convergence                                                          *
                       * sphere                                                                          *
                       * init "dlaw_HI_exp.ini"                                                          *
                       * table SED "QSO.sed"                                                             *
                       * nuL(nu) = 45.0 at 1 Ryd                                                         *
                       * stop temperature off                                                            *
                       * metals 0.001                                                                    *
                       * save last radius ".rad"                                                         *
